{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/unified-system/pulls/86","id":5263594289,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVYdYD88AAAABObwTMQ","html_url":"https://github.com/YehorBabenko88/unified-system/pull/86","diff_url":"https://github.com/YehorBabenko88/unified-system/pull/86.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/YehorBabenko88/unified-system/pull/86.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/unified-system/issues/86","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/unified-system/pulls/86/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/unified-system/pulls/86/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/unified-system/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/unified-system/issues/86/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YehorBabenko88/unified-system/statuses/5fcac999b1daec75707010573606f486f6dccf4d","number":86,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Recognize exact output-cap exception graphs and qualify stock24 on Windows","user":{"login":"YehorBabenko88","id":304050327,"node_id":"U_kgDOEh9wlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/304050327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88","html_url":"https://github.com/YehorBabenko88","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The installation test previously treated any exception from its large-output call as evidence that the output cap worked. It now accepts only the bounded, exact `CHILD_OUTPUT_LIMIT` stock-exception graph; unrelated, mixed, cyclic, oversized or unknown exceptions remain failures. The native workload, phase markers and existing 30s timeout are unchanged.\n\nThis stack adds the shared test classifier, an explicit one-method/24-subcase stock matrix, and a dedicated Windows-hosted exact-source qualification job. The job checks repository/event identity and all 1,875 raw tracked files before importing the qualifier, records runtime/tool origins before and after, and requires actual subcase/RETURN/owned-child retirement evidence plus closed artifact readback. Existing workflows and filters are unchanged.\n\nStacked on [PR82](https://github.com/YehorBabenko88/unified-system/pull/82), branch `feature/level2-preparation-integration-20261110`, observed HEAD `bfa3b24d8f209d5e91acfa64819d3ebed4967af7`. Proposed HEAD `5fcac999b1daec75707010573606f486f6dccf4d`, tree `4104c38700aea12eecfd2db85b92fa77d019e6f0`. Four linear commits, six owned paths; no production module changes.\n\nValidation is deliberately scoped:\n\n- Fresh LF/no-hardlink checkout: all 1,875 raw files and recomputed primary Git blob IDs match; current read-only recheck is clean.\n- Root's separately allocated local stock matrix: one unit/24 cases, actual RETURN 7 TRUE/17 FALSE, one normally retired PowerShell child. Receipt SHA256 `031ec79862874c7483fc9326316b3a506c16bc71c4e2a1a9f4339112b1f5db04`. This exercised stock exceptions, not the native C# workload.\n- Root's four inert actual-function controls at exact5fc: 4 PASS, zero errors/failures/skips, source1,875/runtime841 unchanged. Receipt SHA256 `efad52e24db6b804ce8f0be7114e94f025c0058793149b55030ae251db14eedb`. No whole-qualifier import, real Git/PowerShell fixture or native action occurred in these controls.\n- The new hosted qualifier has NOT run. Source review and inert controls are not hosted Windows, Win11, native-workload or terminal/family containment qualification. Original negative/preparation evidence remains preserved; no reruns or cancellations were used.\n\nFor this exact six-path delta, unchanged filters do not select native-principal, native-negative, Control Mux/Consul, A5 components or storage-publication workflows. Standard root unittest discovery does not select the non-package nested native suites. The ordinary legacy PS/security/stopped-service/full-suite CI remains selected and user-authorized; no workflow is disabled or bypassed.\n\nNo merge, deployment, public submit, trading, provider, physical or broader runtime admission follows from this Draft. Strict D4 logical mutation remains disabled; public submit DENY. Existing F26/native/full-CI limitations remain open.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-11T17:07:30Z","updated_at":"2026-11-11T17:07:30Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9547bd62a458472baf8b5423ee29ab0d5167c190","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"YehorBabenko88:feature/native-output-cap-assertion-20261110","ref":"feature/native-output-cap-assertion-20261110","repo":{"id":1434933263,"node_id":"R_kgDOVYdYDw","name":"unified-system","full_name":"YehorBabenko88/unified-system","owner":{"login":"YehorBabenko88","id":304050327,"node_id":"U_kgDOEh9wlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/304050327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88","html_url":"https://github.com/YehorBabenko88","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"h